# Blog catalog for SEO

MDX `export const meta` is the source of truth for per-post title/excerpt/OG.

After creating or changing post `meta` (slug, title, excerpt, thumbSlug):

```bash
cd packages/frontend && pnpm run export-blog-posts
```

That updates `packages/shared/blog-posts.json` (Go SSR, sitemap, Discord OG). Include the JSON in the same commit. Docker also re-runs the export during image build.
